            <ArticleTitle>Competencies Related to Informatics and Information Management for Practicing Nurses and Nurses Leaders in Brazil and South America.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>77-85</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Informatics and information management competency has an important role for nursing. However, these competencies in Brazil and South America lack definition, and are just beginning to develop in these regions with different realities. This chapter presents information related to the development of informatics competencies for nursing in these areas.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
